## Description: Adds a native All Inventories page to the PS5 gamepad Inventory with compact item-location details, cross-character currencies, furnishing preview, furnishings grouped by furniture category and cataloged from bank, housing storage, and owned houses, guild store listings per guild, and All/Banked/Characters/Storage/Listed source filters, excluding the Craft Bag.
